 *                                                             - 'syntax' entry (see below)
 *                                                             - 'short' entry (see below)
 *                                                             - 'parts' entry (see below)
 *                                                             - 'options' entry (see below)
 *                                                             - 'join' entry determines how to join multiple parts of the string
 *                                                             `  - if $join is a string, it's used as a joiner glue
